<view class="page">
  <view class="hero-card">
    <view class="hero-kicker">求职流程</view>
    <view class="hero-title">按步骤推进，不乱投</view>
    <view class="hero-subtitle">从筛选岗位到投递跟进，每一步都保留人工确认和来源核验。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="flow-list">
    <view wx:for="{{steps}}" wx:key="title" class="flow-card" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="openStep">
      <view class="step-index">{{index + 1}}</view>
      <view class="flow-main">
        <view class="flow-title">{{item.title}}</view>
        <view class="flow-desc">{{item.desc}}</view>
        <view class="flow-action">{{item.action}}</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="guide-note">
    <view class="note-title">投递边界</view>
    <view class="note-text">这个小程序只帮你整理、提醒、核对和记录，不会自动替你投递，也不会编造任何简历内容。</view>
  </view>
</view>
